<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 25.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 25.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maritime King (built 1975) 61,394 dwt del W.C.Australia early Oct redel Singapore-Japan range $5,000 plus $55,000 bonus Noble Chartering.</p>
<p>Mount Ymitos (built 1983) 54,158 dwt del Bin Qasim early October via W.C.India redel S'pore-Japan range $5,300 Noble Chartering.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
